---
import ArticleLayout from '../layouts/ArticleLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<ArticleLayout title="Privacy · Aayush ICT">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>This site does not sell your data. It does not require an account.</p>
  <p>Basic, anonymous analytics may be added later to see which pages are useful. If that
  changes, this page will say so, with the name of the tool used.</p>
  <p>Affiliate links go through partner platforms, which have their own privacy policies.
  I don't control those.</p>
  <p>Questions: reach me on <a href={site.instagram} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a>.</p>
</ArticleLayout>
